    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Verification is planned",
      "items": [
        "A phase at the verification floor needs a committed plan: concurrent implementers at the ceiling, or a critical change",
        "Below the floor it is planned when the confidence outweighs the cost; with none planned the delivery goes straight to consolidation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "After consolidation",
      "items": [
        "Consolidating is not a Git commit; a milestone is committed only after one global Verify node passes, after loading takt-git-commit"
